{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":31342,\"title\":\"A Fazenda\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"A Fazenda is the current Brazilian version of the The Farm reality television show based on the Swedish television series of the same name that was originally created in 2001 by Strix and produced in association with Sony Entertainment and Endemol.\\n\\nThe show is based on a group of celebrities living together twenty-four hours a day in a Farm, isolated from the outside world while having all their steps followed by cameras around-the-clock, with no privacy for three months.\\n\\nThe contestants compete for the chance to win the grand prize by avoiding weekly eviction, until the last celebrity remains at the end of the season that can claim the grand prize. The show is presented by news reporter Britto Junior alongside actress Chris Couto and directed by Rodrigo Carelli. Record's website and a Record-owned pay-per-view channel offer round-the-clock coverage.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yhtmlN21r2s4vCgpLgMkGqv8uaf.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z8FdOGNMe6zKsLsSeNbU3qegqCs.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":3.2,\"voteCount\":17,\"year\":2009,\"genres\":[\"Reality\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":18,\"totalEpisodes\":1615,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"Record\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"BR\",\"name\":\"Brazil\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2026-11-10\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1402834,\"name\":\"Rodrigo Carelli\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":6479302,\"name\":\"Fernando Viudez\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":996215,\"name\":\"Adriane Galisteu\",\"character\":\"Self - Host\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/m3p6SZBg9sqe7sXt5FEEQSaOZLz.jpg\"},{\"id\":1828556,\"name\":\"Sérgio Hondjakoff\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fIIezdacfpY6jirPxDmwjgWk4RO.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"-8txnuQRjWo\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"AjGW8oxTars\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"9ZiePpwIlAE\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[],\"seasonNumber\":2,\"seasonName\":\"Season 2\",\"seasonOverview\":\"A Fazenda 2 was the second season of the Brazilian reality television series A Fazenda which premiered November 15, 2009 with the finale airing on February 10, 2010 on the Record television network.\\n\\nThis season was confirmed on July 2009, before the finale of the first season by Rede Record. Britto Junior and Chris Couto reprise their hosting stints for the show.\\n\\nThe winner was 33 year-old actress Karina Bacchi from São Manuel, São Paulo, who defeated actor André Segatti with 56% of the votes.\\n\\nFellow contestant Ana Paula Oliveira was contender to be a competitor on A Fazenda 4, but ultimately did not return.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9JGjkt4eKy8JE82MQfrBMr9JPmz.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2009-11-14\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Episode 1\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-15\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Episode 2\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-16\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Episode 3\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-17\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Episode 4\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-18\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Episode 5\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-19\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Episode 6\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-20\",\"runtime\":60},{